        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Feed the Beast, Bankerot, Across the Universe\n- People: Jim Sturgess, David Schwimmer, Kim Fupz Aakeson, Clyde Phillips\n- Organizations: AMC\n- Topics: television series, film, acting, music\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Sturgess was born as James Anthony Sturgess on 16 May 1981, and he is an English actor and singer-songwriter.\n- Jim Sturgess had his breakthrough role as Jude in the 2007 musical romance drama film Across the Universe.\n- Feed the Beast is an American crime drama television series based on the Danish series Bankerot by Kim Fupz Aakeson.\n- Clyde Phillips adapted Feed the Beast for AMC.\n- Feed the Beast stars David Schwimmer and Jim Sturgess.",
